The state icons in packages/react/src/components/StateIcon.tsx are adapted from
Lucide. They are vendored rather than depended upon, so that consuming this
library does not force an icon package on the host. One glyph is modified:
`down` uses Lucide's octagon filled, with the inner cross removed, because an
outlined octagon and an outlined circle are indistinguishable at 16px.

